      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, begin by selecting a filter and then applying it."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit implicitly initiates the process and describes the first two concrete steps. Structural init and redundant 'start process' action preserve behaviour without changing flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After applying the filter, click on the Submit button."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct correspondence to the second procedural step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, check if the option to submit is set to \"false\"."
      ],
      "justification": "A conditional check modeled as an action step followed by an explicit XOR branch. Re-typing preserves the decision point behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
