        "guard:b3->e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, if the option to submit is set to \"true\", continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Final conditional check modeled as action/branch. Guard 'true' matches the source; the implicit 'false' guard covers the complementary path. Behavioural flow is preserved."
    },
